      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why i'm typing this. i'm just so tired. like, every single day is just the same cycle of failing, more debt, more expectations i can't meet... i feel like i've just wasted everything and everyone around me is just waiting for me to finally crash and burn. it feels like there's no way to actually fix it, just an endless loop of misery.",
